        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.02556v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-08-03T17:40:46Z",
        "description": "An isolated final user message is often treated as the query in evaluations of AI systems. In a conversation, however, the actionable request may be distributed across preceding turns. We directly test whether that omitted within-conversation context changes answers. For each of 180 English multi-tu",
