        "description": "Numerical simulations of the dynamics of monolayer structures of molecules deposited on a sheet of hexagonal boron nitride (h-BN) have been performed. It is shown that molecules containing benzene rings and hydroxyl groups in their structure can form stable two-dimensional crystals with linear chain",
        "title_cn": "具有扩展OH氢键链的二维晶体的热稳定性"
      },
