        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.02540v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-08-03T17:28:42Z",
        "description": "The evolution of massive stars above 8 M$_\\odot$ depends critically on the amount of mixing above the convective core during the main sequence. However, current models typically extrapolate results from lower-mass stars, where constraints from asteroseismology and eclipsing binary systems are more r",
        "title_cn": "你需要一个更大的核心：校准巨大的恒星模型对抗银河OB型恒星"
      },
      {
        "title": "Uncertainty Is Not Enough: Value-of-Information Routing for Mixtures of LoRA Experts",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.02528v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-08-03T17:24:27Z",
        "description": "Mixtures of low-rank adaptation experts increase parameter-efficient capacity by routing each input through a subset of adapters. Recent dynamic routers activate more experts when the router or prediction is uncertain. This rule silently equates uncertainty with useful additional computation: an unc",
        "title_cn": "不确定性是不够的： LoRA专家混合的信息价值路由"
      },
