        "pubDate": "2026-08-03T17:08:02Z",
        "description": "Sequential decision-making in real-world applications often involves uncertainty about the environment's model. Uncertain Markov decision processes (UMDPs) represent the possible environments as a set of MDPs with shared states and actions but potentially different transition probabilities and rewar",
        "title_cn": "使用小策略集优化不确定MDP中的最小值遗憾"
      },
